WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:11.241
Open USB Backups (/usb-backups) to inspect the attached NTFS USB 3.x NVMe SSD, capacity, WAL LSN, and deduplicated pack counts.

2
00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:21.561
Click Sync Incremental Snapshot Now for a 0.0 s downtime delta backup, and download backup-key.txt for off-site escrow.

3
00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:32.273
Configure Continual Background Sync (automatic reconnect catch-up) or Occasional / On-Demand Visit Sync and save.

4
00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:42.594
Click Safely Eject USB Drive and confirm the green SAFE TO UNPLUG banner before unplugging for laptop offload.
